// rule: SEM-2
// expect: run
// trunc, fract, abs, copysign, fma and powi for f64 and f32. Expected bits are
// the Rust libm crate (rust-lang/compiler-builtins f6c1107f, MIT) trunc,
// copysign and fma, x - trunc(x), and compiler-builtins __powidf2/__powisf2;
// NaN is the one observable NaN, so copysign and abs give it unsigned.
